1. Install required OTS software:

   A collection of tar files containing most of the OTS packages
   required by SDPC components is available from one of the CF
   machines, e,g. mars, in:

        /home/jhouck/omi/omi_ots/tarfiles.

   Installation of these packages is automated by a revision-controlled
   Makefile available from the git repository:

         ssh://git@vex/~/ots_sdpc.git

   The README file in the git repository contains installation
   instructions.

2. Install libtell

   libtell is available from ssh://git@vex/~/libtell.git

3. Run the configure script, compile and install as follows.
   Choose compilers = gfortran | intel, then:

    ./configure  --prefix=$prefix \
                 --with-compilers=$compilers \
                 --with-otsroot=$otsroot \
                 --with-tell=$tell_dir
    make
    make install
